<title>JAPAN: Dio Chemicals plans share split.</title>
<headline>Dio Chemicals plans share split.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dio Chemicals Ltd said on Thursday it planned a 1.1-for-1 share split on January 20, for shareholders as of November 30.</p>
</text>
